OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAll parts will have a dry day
OL,6,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,7,Fsome bright or sunny intervals. Less
OL,8,Fwindy than yesterday with light
OL,9,Fwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry with
OL,12,Fsome late brightness. Then the rest of
OL,13,Fthe night will be dry with clear
OL,14,Fperiods. Becoming chilly in some
OL,15,Fsheltered glens.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FRain reaching western
OL,18,FTayside by late morning, then
OL,19,Foutbreaks of rain spreading across
OL,20,Fremaining areas by afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
