OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry and
OL,6,Fbright on Friday. Rain spreading east
OL,7,Ffor a time on Saturday. Drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter on Sunday with the chance of
OL,9,Fa few showers.
